# Nested patterns require ** — a bare "node_modules" would only exclude the
# context-root one and let workspace packages (web/node_modules) leak into the
# image build context, where Windows pnpm symlinks overwrite the installed deps.
**/node_modules
**/dist
.env
output
.git
.gitignore
*.md
!README.md
.github
.vscode
.biome
fixtures
docs
